# Ashley's manuscript repo (daleas0120/paper-traits-audit), cloned here for
# convenience. It is a SEPARATE git repository with its own remote and
# history, so it must never be staged by this one -- an un-ignored nested
# repo gets recorded as a gitlink, which is a broken half-submodule for
# anyone else who clones.
/paper/

# Local run noise: SLURM stdout/stderr, the thread-driver log, LaTeX build
# logs, and OneDrive's folder-metadata file. None of it is reproducible
# output anyone else needs.
logs/
*.log
desktop.ini

